1
00:00:00,042 --> 00:00:01,710
[16 Years Ago]
Help me!

2
00:00:01,835 --> 00:00:03,420
Help!

3
00:00:04,546 --> 00:00:07,132
I'm here! Please help me!

4
00:00:09,593 --> 00:00:10,593
Gosh, you were here

5
00:00:12,930 --> 00:00:13,930
Hyesung

6
00:00:15,182 --> 00:00:15,724
Are you okay?

7
00:00:15,849 --> 00:00:16,642
Didn't you
get hurt anywhere?

8
00:00:16,767 --> 00:00:20,479
The boy was rescued
from the warehouse

9
00:00:20,604 --> 00:00:23,148
It was my friend
who rescued me

10
00:00:23,273 --> 00:00:26,485
He stayed with me
until I was saved

11
00:00:28,737 --> 00:00:29,737
No, that's not true…

12
00:00:31,949 --> 00:00:32,949
What?

13
00:00:34,451 --> 00:00:35,786
You must've been
freaked out

14
00:00:36,828 --> 00:00:38,080
Yeah, right

15
00:00:38,205 --> 00:00:40,999
That was when
I got claustrophobia

16
00:00:41,124 --> 00:00:43,168
Oh right, I should
write it down too

17
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:47,673
Okay

18
00:00:47,798 --> 00:00:49,007
Just forget all of this

19
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:52,261
Speed test!

20
00:00:52,386 --> 00:00:54,388
How did we first meet?

21
00:00:56,348 --> 00:00:58,100
At a home party
through a friend

22
00:00:58,225 --> 00:00:59,685
What did you like
the most about me?

23
00:01:01,395 --> 00:01:02,145
Your look?

24
00:01:02,271 --> 00:01:03,539
So I'm good-looking
to you, right?

25
00:01:03,563 --> 00:01:04,898
Just move along

26
00:01:06,316 --> 00:01:08,443
Where did we
have our first kiss?

27
00:01:08,568 --> 00:01:10,821
Who'd ask such a thing?

28
00:01:10,946 --> 00:01:12,531
Why are you
bailing this one?

29
00:01:22,582 --> 00:01:23,582
Let's say

30
00:01:26,378 --> 00:01:27,879
we did it at home

31
00:01:30,465 --> 00:01:31,465
What?
